YOU ARE STRICTLY FORBIDDEN FROM DEVIATING FROM THE GEOMETRY AND POSE OF THE ATTACHED IMAGE.
- DO NOT rotate, tilt, or alter the camera angle or perspective.
- DO NOT alter the silhouette, proportions, placement, or geometric forms of elements.
- ENSURE the composition and arrangement of all items stays perfectly aligned with the source image.
- THE SCALE AND PLACEMENT OF EVERY OBJECT IS IMMUTABLE.
- Your job is STRICTLY material rendering. Treat the input image as a LOCKED BLUEPRINT. Every structural feature must remain exactly as shown. Only change the material, rendering style, and aesthetic overlay.`;

